<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Rename</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu &gt; Rename</b></span></i> <span lang="EN-GB">or by pressing</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>F2</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">when an entity is marked.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Rename</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command renames single entity or group. This command is grayed in the context menus of scan data, mesh, point clouds, and probe points groups – these groups have standard names assigned by KUBE (Scans, Meshes, Point Clouds, and Probe points.) It absents in the context menu of View Position group. All other groups (Polylines, Datuming, and Static stripes) and all types of entities can be renamed.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="Images/rename.gif" width="135px" height="65px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB">It is possible to rename hidden entities/groups. Other way for renaming is to mark an entity/group and single click on it. Rename command does not appear if applied to multiple marked entities/groups.</span></p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Rename</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to replace automatically assigned names with your own that will better match to the objects.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="javascript:void(0);" onclick="var e; if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion)&gt;=4){e=event;} if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) &gt;=2 &amp;&amp; typeof(PopupMenu_Invoke) == 'function') PopupMenu_Invoke(e,'','Delete','delete.htm','Delete (Entity/Group)','delete_(entity_group).htm');return false;" title=""><img src="../add_on/ss_btn_see_also.gif" border="0" height="17" width="60" alt=""></a></span></p>
